      "instruction": "DescriptionThis is a children toothbrush, made of high-grade silicone material, safe and durable. Cleaning the surface of the teeth and the internal direction, each brushing can bring a quick and comfortable cleaning experience to the mouth. Features the cartoon donut modeling design, making it attractive for kids.Features-Material: Silicone-High-grade silicone materials, safe and secure, can be used with confidence. -Supple brush head design, does not hurt the mouth, comfortable to use. -Comfortable to hold, the colors are eye-catching, and the baby loves them. -Lovely and unique shape toothbrush, which can attract the attention of your kids.-Compact size and lightweight, and this toothbrush is very convenient to carry.Package Including1 x Kids Toothbrush",
      "query_mode": "text",
